<Legal title="Accessibility Statement" description="TechTide SEO's commitment to an accessible website, what we have done, and how to report a problem." updated="15 October 2026">
  <p>We want everyone to be able to use techtideseo.com. We aim to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at level AA.</p>
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Pages use clear headings, landmarks and a "skip to content" link.</li>
    <li>You can use the whole site with a keyboard, with visible focus indicators.</li>
    <li>Colours are chosen for readable contrast in both light and dark mode.</li>
    <li>Forms have labels and clear status messages.</li>
    <li>Animations respect the "reduce motion" setting on your device.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Known limitations</h2>
  <p>We review the site regularly but may miss issues, especially in newly published content. Some older blog images may not yet have full text alternatives; we are adding them as we update each post.</p>
  <h2>Tell us about a problem</h2>
  <p>If you find something hard to use, email info@techtideseo.com with the page address and what went wrong. We aim to reply within 2 business days.</p>
</Legal>
